WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.985
♪ No one told me about her ♪

00:00:03.985 --> 00:00:07.492
♪ What could I do? ♪

00:00:07.492 --> 00:00:11.442
♪ Well, no one told me about her ♪

00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:14.103
♪ Though they all knew ♪

00:00:14.103 --> 00:00:17.453
♪ But it's too late to say you're sorry ♪

00:00:17.453 --> 00:00:18.919
♪ How would I know? ♪

00:00:18.919 --> 00:00:21.296
♪ Why should I care? ♪

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:24.799
♪ Please don't bother trying to find her ♪

00:00:24.799 --> 00:00:27.606
♪ She's not there ♪

00:00:27.606 --> 00:00:30.236
♪ Well, let me tell you
'bout the way she looked ♪

00:00:30.236 --> 00:00:33.922
♪ The way she acted and
the color of her hair ♪

00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:35.701
♪ Her voice was soft and cool ♪

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.579
♪ Her eyes were clear and bright ♪

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:40.746
♪ But she's not there ♪

00:01:09.895 --> 00:01:13.755
♪ Well, no one told me about her ♪

00:01:13.755 --> 00:01:17.575
♪ What could I do ♪

00:01:17.575 --> 00:01:20.631
♪ Well, no one told me about her ♪

00:01:20.631 --> 00:01:22.881
(laughing)

00:01:24.254 --> 00:01:27.088
♪ But it's too late to say I'm sorry ♪

00:01:27.088 --> 00:01:28.440
♪ How would I know ♪

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.299
♪ Why should I care ♪

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:34.242
♪ Please don't bother trying to find her ♪

00:01:34.242 --> 00:01:37.178
♪ She's not there ♪

00:01:37.178 --> 00:01:39.679
♪ Well, I can tell you
about the way she looks ♪

00:01:39.679 --> 00:01:43.455
♪ The way she acted and
the color of her hair ♪

00:01:43.455 --> 00:01:45.173
♪ Her voice was soft and cool ♪

00:01:45.173 --> 00:01:46.614
♪ Her eyes were clear and bright ♪

00:01:46.614 --> 00:01:49.631
♪ But she's not there ♪

00:01:49.631 --> 00:01:54.031
♪ I smell blossom and the trees are bare ♪

00:01:54.031 --> 00:01:57.433
♪ All day long I seem to walk on air ♪

00:01:57.433 --> 00:02:01.142
(laughing)
♪ I wonder why ♪

00:02:01.142 --> 00:02:03.027
♪ I wonder why ♪

00:02:03.027 --> 00:02:05.181
- You join in, you two.

00:02:05.181 --> 00:02:07.349
- No, no, no, I don't sing, I don't sing.

00:02:07.349 --> 00:02:09.220
- Oh, turn it up.

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.230
Turn it up, I love this song.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.668
- Want it louder?
- All the way.

00:02:13.668 --> 00:02:16.751
(upbeat, band music)

00:02:28.438 --> 00:02:30.271
- Colin, wild cracker.

00:02:32.548 --> 00:02:34.598
Tell him, I thought I'm fine.

00:02:34.598 --> 00:02:37.681
(upbeat dance mucic)

00:02:41.212 --> 00:02:45.020
- [Woman] Do we have one more chair?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.803
- Happiness is a fickle creature.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.950
Constant companion to some,

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:52.773
hides herself completely from others.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.553
She's been an elusive creature to me.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:03.000
But, here she is,
finally, sitting among us,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.483
and I say, welcome.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:09.963
I won't mention how later her arrival is.

00:03:12.135 --> 00:03:13.543
- Who?
- Hmm?

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.043
Happiness, dear.

00:03:19.071 --> 00:03:21.493
Oh, nevermind.

00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:24.890
- [Man] Yes sir, no problem, right.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.300
- Cream?

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.090
- I'm not burning, am I?

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:28.923
- Not yet.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:31.303
Better safe than sorry.

00:03:37.654 --> 00:03:41.154
(camera shutter clicking)

00:03:42.074 --> 00:03:44.741
(ominous music)

